1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:09,085
Deutsche Welle reports that Europe’s extreme summer heat is now being measured in deaths, lost output and damaged crops.

2
00:00:09,035 --> 00:00:18,491
Scientists say human-caused climate change made the heat more severe, even as some politicians describe it as normal summer weather.

3
00:00:18,491 --> 00:00:26,520
The article notes pressure on health systems, farms, roads and energy plants across the continent.

